<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">👀</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Applying human judgment and oversight</strong></div>
</div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🛠️</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;"><strong>Recognizing where AI appears in everyday tools</strong></div>
</div>

